Variable Subtraction_amount
WindState: 2,98,82,720,350
ValueState: 2,748,75,621,243,,MIDM
Title: Subtraction amount
Units: $
NodeLocation: 680,384,1
Description: The amount saved by the lower tax rates for the first part of your income, compared to just multiplying your tax bracket by your total income. With this pre-compiled table, it makes it easy to find your tax due once you know your marginal tax rate.
NodeSize: 56,32
Definition: (Bracket_bottom_income * Tax_bracket - Tax_up_to_bracket)[Tax_bracket=Marginal_rate, defVal:0]
ReformVal: [Filing_status,Tax_bracket]
NumberFormat: 2,F,2,2,1,1,2,1,$,0,"ABBREV",0,,,0,0,15
{!50000|Att_ColumnWidths: [,Filing_status,\([87])]}

