Module Alternate_ways_to_co
NodeInfo: 1,0,1,1,1,1,0,,0,,0,,,
Author: Lonnie Chrisman, Ph.D.~
Lumina Decision Systems
Date: Wed, Apr 4, 2018 3:42 PM
Title: Alternate ways to compute tax due
NodeLocation: 528,952,1
Description: The method of using a Subtraction Amount is not the only method possible for computing tax due. This module shows another methods, using Dispatch. I've included these for instructional purposes. Depreciation schedules often have a similar structure, and sometimes these techniques are a better match.
NodeSize: 80,24
DiagState: 2,320,186,944,512,17
WindState: 2,222,587,720,350

